Browser runtime
---------------
Roost connects to a Chromium instance via CDP (the chromium-sidecar
Docker image). Chromium is a separate piece of software with its own
license (BSD-3-Clause + LGPL components). Roost does not bundle or
redistribute Chromium binaries — the sidecar is a runtime dependency
pulled at deploy time.

