How to regenerate this file
---------------------------
```
pip install pip-licenses
pip-licenses --format=plain --with-urls --order=license > NOTICES.detailed
```

The `NOTICES.detailed` output above is intentionally not committed —
the list of transitive dependencies changes with every pin bump. This
NOTICES file covers the direct dependencies Roost intentionally ships
against; consumers redistributing built artefacts should regenerate
the detailed inventory for their own environment.
